    "_provenance_historical_series": "population_init and gdp_per_capita_init cover 2000-2023. 2000-2019 are the original calibrated series; 2020-2023 are chain-linked onto the 2019 level using year-on-year growth from World Bank WLD indicators SP.POP.TOTL and NY.GDP.MKTP.CD (current US$, retrieved 2026-08). Chain-linking rather than direct substitution avoids a vintage step at 2019/2020 (the current vintage puts 2019 population 0.44% and GDP/capita 0.77% above the calibrated series), which would otherwise show up as spurious 2020 growth. rpk_init 2020-2023 comes from resources/historical_data/world_air_transport_traffic_1929_2024.csv.",
